'''Crocodylidae Kurocroc''' (超牙獣クロコックス, ''Chō Gajū Kurokokkusu'', '''Super Fang-Beast Kurokox''') is a [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Croco]] that first appears in [[Empress' Excavation 5]]. They were added in [[Version 12.6 Update|Version 12.6]].

