==Trivia==
*[[wikipedia:Crocodylidae|Crocodylidae]] is a family of reptiles, commonly referred to as crocodiles.
**Although Kurocroc's English description calls them a gator, alligators are not in the family Crocodylidae, but rather their own family, [[wikipedia:Alligatoridae|Alligatoridae]]. This discrepancy is not present in their Japanese name and description.
***[[Zroco]] has a similar issue, where its English description says it's a gator and its Japanese description calls it a crocodile.
*Judging by their Japanese name (クロコックス ''Kurokokkusu'', "Kurokox" or "Crocox"), winged forelimbs, spiny tail, high speed and [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] trait, Crocodylidae Kurocroc's ''Monster Hunter'' reference is [[wikia:monsterhunter:Brute Tigrex|Brute Tigrex]], also known as the Black Roaring Wyvern. Kurocroc's red eyes and the markings on their forelimbs are based on how Brute Tigrex accelerates its own blood circulation when enraged, making its own bright red veins visible through these parts of its body.
**Kurocroc could have also been inspired by [[wikia:monsterhunter:Nargacuga|Nargacuga]], which has red eyes, black scales and a similar tail and forelimbs, but this is less likely due to [[THE FOLIVOREAN]] already referencing Nargacuga.
*The "Kuro" in Kurocroc's name is a pun: not only is it the Japanese word for black, but it's also part of クロコダイル ''kurokodairu'' (crocodile).
*Although Kurocroc's description says they stalk prey throughout the primeval wood, none of the stages they appear in have a woodland-based name or [[Backgrounds|background]].
*Crocodylidae Kurocroc has the highest movement speed of all Behemoths, and is tied with [[Poultrio|Poultrio]] for the highest knockback count of all Dark enemies.

